# Firmware design documents — agent read-only

**Agents: READ ONLY.** Do not create, edit, rewrite, reformat, or “fix” firmware design / planning documentation in this repo.

## Protected paths

- `README.md`
- `OVERRUN.md`
- `skills_planner.md`
- `docs/**` (all notes, baselines, schematics, datasheets, PDFs, drawings)

## Allowed

- **Read** these files for architecture, pinout, UAC2, sample-rate, and I2S facts.
- Edit **code** under `src/`, `examples/`, `boards/`, CMake, etc. only when the user asks for a firmware code change.
- If docs and code disagree, report it and wait — do not silently rewrite the docs.

## Owner

Only the human owner may change the protected design documents.
